> Is this a bug? Or, at least regarding casting while eating, and as
> TDTTOE, naga are not really polite?
> 
1. Were you burdened?

2. This is the result of having to handle several circumstances in a
"move" and if this result was "fixed" some other set would result in
another set of messages which don't make sense when repeated in order.
Think of them as what was done in that "move" and ignore the order it
states them. It's not a "bug" per se, more a quirk of nethack you'll see
on *very* rare occasions. You have to be moving at least 1/2 the speed
of something around you and survive long enough for one of those
somethings to do two things significant. Pretty risky buisness.




